### 17. Architecture Diagram Storage 🟢

**Purpose:** Store versioned architecture diagrams (Phase 3)

**Extend:** `artifact-store` (already supports file storage via object-store)

**No new tables needed** (use `artifacts` table with `artifact_type = 'architecture_diagram'`)

**New MCP Tools:**
- `artifact_upload_diagram(project_id, diagram_file, title)` -- upload PNG/SVG
- `artifact_get_diagram(artifact_id)` -- retrieve diagram

---

### 18. Loop-Back Mechanism 🟢

**Purpose:** Create new projects from bugs/features in Phase 9

**Extend:** `workflow-engine` (service layer logic)

**No new tables needed** (logic only)

**New MCP Tools:**
- `workflow_create_from_bug(bug_id, application_type)` -- create project from bug
- `workflow_create_from_feedback(feedback_id, application_type)` -- create project from feature request

